{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">藝人楊明與莊思明（Lisa）這對圈中公認的恩愛愛侶終於傳來喜訊！二人早前宣佈將於今年8月2日於馬來西亞吉隆坡舉行盛大婚禮。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">雖然整個婚禮的籌備時間只有約兩個月</span>，但在專業團隊的妥善規劃下，兩人目前心情輕鬆，正沉醉於忙碌而甜蜜的備婚節奏中，不過亦笑言預計到婚禮當天必定會緊張萬分。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8799e1b6-d752-4f3f-a827-fe537fe0cd9f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026SAzVZPGPFk1785222464.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8799e1b6-d752-4f3f-a827-fe537fe0cd9f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">是次婚禮二人極具心思，單是行禮婚紗、Pre-wedding 晚裝以及婚禮現場的晚裝，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">總花費已過百萬。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/>為了記錄愛情最美的一刻，兩人特別安排前往上海、香港及吉隆坡三個城市拍攝 Pre-wedding 婚紗照，將不同城市的浪漫風情盡收鏡頭之下。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">此外，兩人更親赴廣州拍攝充滿創意的婚禮短片（Video）。短片特別巧妙融入了 AI 技術，配合生活化又有趣的溫馨主題，將兩人多年來的甜蜜點滴完美呈現。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"39b6ed86-0b11-4fe5-a5d1-ddd0fea55ea1.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026kFFeHmK3DS1785222464.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"39b6ed86-0b11-4fe5-a5d1-ddd0fea55ea1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f332b7be-031c-4a74-a807-62cf11dab2f0.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026rWR5KigyWI1785222464.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f332b7be-031c-4a74-a807-62cf11dab2f0.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4efdddc1-36b5-4fc5-af54-c071a445c9d2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20266nWA6t9yab1785222464.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4efdddc1-36b5-4fc5-af54-c071a445c9d2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"57592e2d-5769-4927-b48d-c9fe9c09701f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026w4CoDY6oso1785222464.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"57592e2d-5769-4927-b48d-c9fe9c09701f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cf0fe899-b311-4f92-9999-a683e19a71f7.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026IX226Eo69J1785222464.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cf0fe899-b311-4f92-9999-a683e19a71f7.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">談到求婚過程，過去楊明雖已多次向傳媒及好友透露過求婚意向，令莊思明早已心理準備，未有預期會有太大驚喜。豈料，楊明原來早已暗中密謀大驚喜！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">在廣州拍攝婚禮 Video 期間，楊明於其中一個拍攝情節中，突發在大街上當眾單膝下跪，正式向莊思明遞上戒指求婚。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">面對突如其來的街頭驚喜，莊思明既感動又驚喜，當場感動落淚，為這段長跑多年的愛情<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">添上最浪漫的註腳。</span><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T08:07:11.818084+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":513,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}